flowchart TD
    A[Start booklet from dashboard] --> S[Submit storyline<br/>by text or voice]
    S --> Q[Agent identifies plot gaps]
    Q --> QD{Plot gaps identified?}

    QD -- Yes --> QG[Generate up to 8 focused questions<br/>to close the plot gaps]
    QG --> QC[Present one generative UI question card<br/>and collect the answer]
    QC --> QM{More generated questions?}
    QM -- Yes --> QC
    QM -- No --> P
    QD -- No --> P

    P[Generate, review, edit,<br/>and confirm the whole plot]
    P --> ST[Select a visual style from<br/>recommended inventory options]
    ST --> CH[Select and adjust<br/>inventory characters]
    CH --> LK[Generate, review, edit, and confirm<br/>locked style and character references]
    LK --> CS[Generate, review, edit,<br/>and confirm the character sheet]
    CS --> BS[Generate, review, edit,<br/>and confirm booklet specifications]
    BS --> FS[Generate, review, edit, and confirm<br/>the full story and panel cards]
    FS --> GEN[Start mocked generation,<br/>return to dashboard, and show Generating]
